  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Three Immortal Gu Houses hover over the ruined field at Heavenly Lotus Sect: Canary Pavilion, Yue Yang Palace, and the rank eight Heavenly Pool. Shadow Sect’s group focuses on Heavenly Pool. Seven Star Child treats Yue Yang Palace and Canary Pavilion as also very difficult to handle. When the group pulls back, the three houses chase.",
